HB0178 Work allowance for voting.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Sherwood, Byron, Campbell, E,
Harshman, Provenza, Storer, Wylie and Yin and
Senator(s) Anderson, Nethercott, Pappas, Rothfuss and
Schuler
AN ACT relating to elections; specifying when an employee is entitled to take
time off of work to vote in an election; increasing the amount of time that an
employee is entitled to take off of work to vote; making a conforming amendment;
and providing for an effective date.
